WEBVTT

00:00.750 --> 00:02.880
Never forget your poker face.

00:02.880 --> 00:04.590
With his father’s teachings in his heart,

00:04.590 --> 00:07.010
the miraculous magician glides through skyscrapers.

00:07.010 --> 00:09.010
Enter Kaitō Kid!

00:09.010 --> 00:12.430
Today’s target is the Purple-eyed Bronze Statue!

00:12.430 --> 00:15.220
Now, it’s show time!

00:15.220 --> 00:19.650
I love your tears so much

00:19.770 --> 00:22.360
Wow This Summer day Summer night

00:22.520 --> 00:25.530
I want you to laugh beside me

00:34.160 --> 00:37.870
On a pier on a warm sandy beach

00:38.160 --> 00:42.630
The miracle I longed for finally came true

00:44.630 --> 00:48.380
Please, stay with me, just like this

00:48.760 --> 00:52.260
Everything for you, I’ll always think of you

00:54.850 --> 00:58.560
I miss the nights with shooting stars

00:58.890 --> 01:03.520
I wish and sing with all of my voice

01:05.110 --> 01:09.200
I can’t stop my sweet song anymore

01:09.360 --> 01:13.910
In a tearful voice I cry ‘I love you’

01:14.700 --> 01:19.160
When you like someone so much that you can’t verbalise it

01:19.160 --> 01:21.750
Wow This Summer day Summer night

01:21.750 --> 01:24.460
Everything’s a treasure (baby)

01:24.790 --> 01:29.090
Your smile gives me so much courage

01:29.420 --> 01:34.680
as I embrace this fleeting love

01:34.850 --> 01:39.600
I’ve always, always been watching you from your side.

01:56.660 --> 01:58.460
My name is Kaito Kuroba!

01:58.470 --> 02:04.690
My father, Tōichi Kuroba, was a world-famous magician, as well as Kaitō Kid, the greatest thief of the century.

02:05.310 --> 02:07.480
In order to track down the organisation that killed my father…

02:07.500 --> 02:09.490
I became the second Kid…

02:09.490 --> 02:12.490
And I'm going to get my hands on the big jewel they're after.

02:13.610 --> 02:15.560
During the day, I'm an ordinary high school student;

02:15.560 --> 02:18.450
but at night, I'm a great thief who appears as if from nowhere and vanishes without a trace.

02:18.450 --> 02:20.770
My childhood friend, Aoko Nakamori.

02:20.770 --> 02:22.870
The descendant of a witch, Akako Koizumi.

02:22.870 --> 02:25.290
Inspector Nakamori from the Metropolitan Police Department.

02:25.290 --> 02:27.880
A mysterious organisation and their pawns.

02:28.380 --> 02:30.750
Until I track down the one who's pulling their strings...

02:30.750 --> 02:33.240
I won't even consider stopping my activities as Kaitō Kid!

02:36.850 --> 02:36.890
The Splendid Rivals

03:11.180 --> 03:13.010
Ladies and gentlemen!

03:18.550 --> 03:21.360
Welcome to my dream!

04:26.300 --> 04:28.340
I'm so envious!

04:28.330 --> 04:35.260
A show by the world's greatest illusionist, Günter von Goldberg II, here in Japan!

04:35.260 --> 04:38.790
Even here, they're super premium tickets.

04:38.800 --> 04:42.760
It was thanks to an arrangement with one of his classmates, Akako Koizumi.

04:43.400 --> 04:47.270
More importantly, Madam, any development in your investigation?

04:47.270 --> 04:51.550
No. I've been checking here and there but with no luck.

04:51.550 --> 04:54.390
Please, don't force yourself.

04:54.400 --> 04:58.030
How could I ever face Master Tōichi if something were to happen to you?

04:58.030 --> 05:00.820
Don't worry. When it comes to thieves…

05:00.820 --> 05:04.290
Unlike the first Kid, I'm a veteran.

05:04.290 --> 05:06.080
That's why I'm worried.

05:06.100 --> 05:06.700
At any rate…

05:06.700 --> 05:10.170
At any rate, I'm leaving Kaito to you.

05:11.300 --> 05:12.400
I understand.

05:26.660 --> 05:27.880
It was great!

05:27.890 --> 05:30.140
I have no idea how he did it!

05:30.640 --> 05:35.610
He probably relied on the latest digital effects and group hypnosis.

05:36.220 --> 05:38.070
If you saw it again you'd probably be able to see through it.

05:38.070 --> 05:39.320
You're the same.

05:39.320 --> 05:44.070
In any case, the tricks once praised as illusionism,

05:44.070 --> 05:47.490
and you magicians who make witches and magic look fake,

05:47.500 --> 05:50.400
are all the same. My enemies.

05:50.400 --> 05:53.080
Did you bring us here just to say that?

05:53.080 --> 05:55.960
Regardless, I have no idea what you mean.

05:56.510 --> 05:57.900
Akako-<i>chan</i>, thank you.

05:57.900 --> 05:59.320
It was fun!

05:59.300 --> 06:00.760
And what do you mean by ‘enemy?’

06:02.290 --> 06:03.340
It's nothing.

06:03.340 --> 06:05.350
If you're having fun then I'm happy too.

06:05.350 --> 06:06.380
Geez…

06:11.650 --> 06:12.690
Who's that guy?

06:16.070 --> 06:19.650
NOTICE

06:16.070 --> 06:19.650
At 8:00 tonight, I will come to take the Purple-eyed Bronze Statue in the Ekoda Museum!

06:16.070 --> 06:19.650
- Kaitō Kid

06:20.100 --> 06:22.440
All right, listen up!

06:22.440 --> 06:28.230
Though we should of course arrest Kaitō Kid, make sure you protect the Purple-eyed Bronze Statue!

06:28.230 --> 06:28.630
Yes, sir!

06:29.370 --> 06:34.920
Because our confrontation with Kid
is being broadcasted live on TV!

06:33.620 --> 06:36.120
Arrested tonight!?

06:34.920 --> 06:36.360
Is it really true?

06:36.860 --> 06:37.910
No way, no way.

06:37.910 --> 06:39.180
We've got to see this!

06:39.180 --> 06:40.800
Let's record this and save it.

06:42.150 --> 06:44.440
It's an ad for the police anyway, right?

06:44.440 --> 06:46.700
Though I hope they don't get humiliated.

06:47.400 --> 06:49.350
Reporting from the Ekoda Museum.

06:49.350 --> 06:52.070
This is the site mentioned in Kaitō Kid's advance notice.

06:52.070 --> 06:54.320
There are now less than than 2 hours until 8:00.

06:54.980 --> 06:56.360
T-That's...

07:04.730 --> 07:08.750
The time has now come for us, the Japanese police, to show the world what we can do!

07:09.300 --> 07:12.790
8 helicopters in the sky; a total of 200 people deployed in the building!

07:13.540 --> 07:17.460
Furthermore, there are countless security sensors operating underground!

07:17.460 --> 07:20.630
Never mind Kid, not even a mouse could slip in!

07:24.130 --> 07:26.050
You morons!

07:27.340 --> 07:29.100
Just get to your stations already!

07:28.120 --> 07:31.310
Your dad hasn't changed a bit.

07:31.310 --> 07:32.180
Guess not.

07:33.810 --> 07:35.900
All right, synchronise your watches!

07:36.750 --> 07:37.810
The time is now…

07:38.550 --> 07:40.230
Monday, September 3.

07:41.530 --> 07:44.620
It's 6:12:16.05 PM.

07:46.160 --> 07:50.030
My watch doesn't get out of sync but 0.001 seconds in a year.

07:50.780 --> 07:52.450
Rely on me as a reference.

07:54.580 --> 07:55.710
Who's he?

07:55.710 --> 07:57.940
You don't know him, Inspector?

07:57.940 --> 08:00.380
A famous high school detective from London…

08:00.920 --> 08:02.710
You're the true culprit!

08:07.760 --> 08:09.050
I'd like to ask you one thing.

08:09.680 --> 08:10.970
Why would you do such a thing?

08:12.250 --> 08:14.910
I-I've got a sick daughter…

08:20.440 --> 08:24.610
"The high school great detective, Saguru Hakuba, does it again!"

08:24.820 --> 08:29.660
"Sees through the true culprit's trick!"

08:27.360 --> 08:29.820
What do you mean 'why would you do such a thing?!'

08:29.820 --> 08:31.920
Bad guys don't have any reason!

08:31.920 --> 08:32.900
Hakuba-<i>kun</i>…

08:32.910 --> 08:37.150
Your refusal of Scotland Yard's request to support an investigation and your return...

08:37.150 --> 08:39.560
It was to catch Kaitō Kid, wasn't it?!

08:40.130 --> 08:42.050
I don't know. Maybe.

08:42.050 --> 08:43.070
Hakuba?

08:43.070 --> 08:44.990
Let me see, I've got the feeling I've heard that somewhere…

08:44.990 --> 08:46.390
T-That's why…

08:46.390 --> 08:49.980
I can assure you that Kid's crimes end tonight.

08:52.710 --> 08:54.090
What an impudent thing to say!

08:54.090 --> 08:57.280
This isn't a place for amateurs! Go home! Go home!

08:57.280 --> 08:58.620
I-Inspector…

08:59.070 --> 09:03.110
Well now, Nakamori-<i>kun</i>, Don't be so hard on him.

09:03.110 --> 09:05.480
S-Superintendent General Hakuba...

09:05.500 --> 09:08.060
That's actually my son.

09:08.070 --> 09:09.700
Your…?!

09:09.720 --> 09:13.540
He said he wanted to see Kaitō Kid with his own eyes just once.

09:13.530 --> 09:15.450
Couldn't you have said that earlier?!

09:15.460 --> 09:16.530
Now, now…

09:16.530 --> 09:20.300
Saguru gets carried away with the media.

09:20.290 --> 09:22.920
He hasn't been listening to me much lately.

09:22.920 --> 09:26.630
From here on in, you've got to show him how tense the scene is.

09:26.630 --> 09:30.460
If that's the case, then leave it to me, Ginzō Nakamori!

09:30.470 --> 09:32.010
Well, I'm counting on you.

09:34.280 --> 09:37.260
Ask me anything you don't understand.

09:37.260 --> 09:39.520
Then allow me to ask you this.

09:39.520 --> 09:41.190
What is Kaitō Kid's gender?

09:42.610 --> 09:45.190
Probably, a man…?

09:45.210 --> 09:47.480
Yes. He's a man! A man!

09:47.480 --> 09:50.100
Then what is his age? His day of birth?

09:50.100 --> 09:52.100
His blood type? His height?

09:52.100 --> 09:54.740
His weight? His physique? His hairstyle?

09:54.740 --> 09:57.160
His hobbies? The type of woman he likes?

09:57.170 --> 09:58.490
I-I don't know.

09:58.490 --> 10:00.080
You're hopeless.

10:00.080 --> 10:02.750
You've been chasing after him for over 8 years and you don't even know that?

10:02.770 --> 10:05.050
However, not to worry.

10:05.040 --> 10:08.170
I have no interest in petty thieves like Kid.

10:09.470 --> 10:11.380
The one I want to catch…

10:11.380 --> 10:14.050
Excuse me. I have work to do.

10:14.930 --> 10:18.850
There are now 20 minutes left until 8:00 PM, the time on the notice!

10:21.430 --> 10:22.230
This is…

10:25.470 --> 10:29.030
So you've come after all, Spider.

10:29.930 --> 10:33.470
Is Kaitō Kid really going to appear like we've expected?!

10:34.500 --> 10:35.920
Skies: clear!

10:36.650 --> 10:38.070
The roof: clear!

10:39.160 --> 10:41.910
Corridors on each floor, stairs: clear!

10:42.320 --> 10:43.810
Underground: clear!

10:45.670 --> 10:47.790
As expected, Kid got scared.

10:47.790 --> 10:50.750
Inspector, how many people did you deploy underground?

10:51.220 --> 10:52.730
I didn't deploy anyone.

10:52.730 --> 10:56.300
Kid isn't foolish enough to pass through the countless sensors!

11:07.570 --> 11:10.900
Sorry to keep you waiting… Kaitō Kid has arrived.

11:14.390 --> 11:16.070
This is too much.

11:19.600 --> 11:23.210
But I've got this!

11:23.670 --> 11:24.920
Around there?

11:28.490 --> 11:34.010
They're not going to think I'm coming from inside their sensors.

11:34.530 --> 11:35.720
7 minutes left!

11:35.720 --> 11:38.550
Kaitō Kid still hasn't made his appearance!

11:38.550 --> 11:39.430
Is it as we expected?!

11:41.050 --> 11:42.600
Arrived!

11:42.600 --> 11:44.830
Now I can get the treasure at last…

11:49.300 --> 11:53.940
September 3, 7:56:18.53 PM.

11:54.340 --> 11:56.030
That's far enough, Kaitō Kid.

11:56.440 --> 11:57.780
W-What?!

12:16.940 --> 12:18.480
2 minutes left!

12:18.480 --> 12:22.320
Only 2 minutes left until 8:00 PM, the time on the notice!

12:22.760 --> 12:24.170
I wonder what happened.

12:24.150 --> 12:28.240
Like I told you, Kid got scared of my dad as expected.

12:28.610 --> 12:32.160
'Why would you do such a thing?' is what I originally wanted to ask you…

12:32.550 --> 12:34.920
But let's hurry up and close the curtains on this circus.

12:34.920 --> 12:37.790
Kaitō Kid, you're nothing more than just bait.

12:37.790 --> 12:40.210
Bait? What're you talking about?

12:45.260 --> 12:46.930
H-Hypnosis Gas?!

12:46.930 --> 12:49.850
Now there's less than 2 minutes left!

12:49.850 --> 12:51.750
What's wrong, Kid?

12:51.750 --> 12:53.270
If you're coming then hurry up and come!

12:53.270 --> 12:54.930
Give yourself up!

12:54.930 --> 12:57.730
It's your loss, Kaitō Kid.

12:57.730 --> 12:59.230
I wonder about that!

13:03.400 --> 13:04.820
Bloody hell!

13:05.530 --> 13:09.740
20 seconds left… 19, 18, 17…

13:10.430 --> 13:14.450
10 seconds left… 9, 8, 7…

13:19.330 --> 13:21.020
I-Inspector!

13:21.020 --> 13:22.340
There's an intruder underground!

13:22.340 --> 13:23.130
What?!

13:23.130 --> 13:26.470
5 seconds left… 4, 3…

13:26.470 --> 13:29.020
2, 1… 0!

13:31.400 --> 13:32.550
W-What's this?!

13:38.890 --> 13:40.060
Y-You?!

13:40.060 --> 13:45.100
September 3, 8:04:31.07 PM.

13:45.110 --> 13:49.530
Kaitō Kid has been caught by the one and only Saguru Hakuba.

13:50.090 --> 13:51.950
What'd you say?!

13:54.990 --> 13:55.910
Kid was...

13:57.120 --> 13:57.830
Sweet!

13:57.830 --> 13:59.490
You've got to be kidding!

13:59.490 --> 14:01.250
So the police got humiliated after all.

14:01.250 --> 14:04.210
A-And then, where's Kid?

14:04.210 --> 14:05.670
He's sleeping in the basement.

14:06.310 --> 14:08.760
Everyone to the basement!!

14:09.380 --> 14:10.750
Arrest Kid!!

14:11.720 --> 14:14.960
Hakuba-<i>kun</i>, how do you feel about having caught Kid?

14:14.960 --> 14:18.020
It was very easy.

14:21.100 --> 14:23.440
What's with that balloon?

14:27.260 --> 14:28.300
T-This is?!

14:28.780 --> 14:32.490
I think I want to make my exit now.

14:35.160 --> 14:38.220
I-Inspector! The one underground is not Kid!

14:38.220 --> 14:39.650
It's Detective Hakuba!!

14:39.650 --> 14:41.080
W-What'd you say?!

14:41.080 --> 14:43.540
Which means you're...?!

14:48.920 --> 14:50.880
K-Kaitō Kid!

14:54.540 --> 14:55.630
O-Oh, no…

14:56.840 --> 14:59.730
Y-Yeah! My dad has to be the one to catch Kaitō Kid.

14:59.730 --> 15:03.400
At last!!

14:59.730 --> 15:03.400
Kid has made his appearance!

14:59.730 --> 15:03.400
I-It's Kid! Kid has appeared at last!

15:03.400 --> 15:05.590
Damn you, Kid!!

15:06.980 --> 15:09.400
You've better watch out where you move, Inspector.

15:11.450 --> 15:12.820
See ya.

15:19.160 --> 15:20.620
W-What's that?

15:20.990 --> 15:23.000
Is it that idiot's doing?!

15:39.450 --> 15:41.830
Dang, this isn't it…

15:41.830 --> 15:47.030
Pandora, the stone of life that the organisation that killed my father is after, isn't in this.

15:47.030 --> 15:49.190
Inspector, I'm returning this after all!

15:49.190 --> 15:51.110
W-What?

15:51.110 --> 15:53.030
See ya!

15:58.870 --> 16:00.310
K-Kid!

16:00.980 --> 16:02.790
Helicopters! Go after Kid!!

16:02.790 --> 16:04.830
Kaitō Kid escaped!

16:04.830 --> 16:08.420
Kid left the Purple-eyed Bronze Statue behind and escaped!

16:19.360 --> 16:21.530
Good night.

16:21.530 --> 16:23.420
That was such a waste of time.

16:23.420 --> 16:25.390
I think I'm going to go home, take a bath, and go to sleep.

16:34.150 --> 16:35.570
Who...?

16:36.170 --> 16:39.030
Welcome, Kaitō Kid.

16:39.600 --> 16:42.080
To your nightmare.

16:59.040 --> 17:00.600
W-What's this?!

17:18.780 --> 17:21.030
Lady Akako!

17:21.720 --> 17:23.270
Quiet! I know.

17:28.420 --> 17:30.790
L-Lucifer has…?!

17:34.210 --> 17:36.920
Yes. He just informed me.

17:37.600 --> 17:40.010
This illusion is unmistakably that…

17:44.890 --> 17:48.310
I-It's an illusion. This is just an illusion!

17:48.710 --> 17:52.230
Like I'd fall for such a childish trick!

17:57.570 --> 17:59.550
I am Spider.

18:00.000 --> 18:02.490
I'm inside your nightmare.

18:21.350 --> 18:22.680
H-Hakuba?!

18:23.220 --> 18:25.010
That's far enough, Spider!!

18:34.690 --> 18:36.150
Spider...

18:36.650 --> 18:38.570
You again…

18:39.380 --> 18:40.660
You are persistent.

18:42.490 --> 18:43.650
W-What?!

18:52.830 --> 18:53.750
Don't joke with me!!

18:57.510 --> 18:58.420
There!!

19:05.870 --> 19:08.600
S-So you were lifting me with that contraption…

19:09.810 --> 19:14.940
You've got some nerve to challenge the one and only Kaitō Kid with a trick like that.

19:17.820 --> 19:19.280
Kid…

19:23.580 --> 19:26.330
Who are you? Why are you after me?!

19:28.370 --> 19:30.040
He's a hired assassin!

19:30.040 --> 19:33.580
He's the world's greatest assassin, and I, Saguru Hakuba, have been after him all this time.

19:33.580 --> 19:35.500
H-Hired assassin?!

19:35.500 --> 19:37.200
The helicopters were going after a dummy!

19:37.200 --> 19:39.200
Hakuba-<i>kun</i>, is Kid there?!

19:39.200 --> 19:40.670
He's on the roof! Hurry!!

19:40.670 --> 19:41.050
Roger!!

19:46.850 --> 19:49.640
Here I thought this would be an easy and boring job…

19:50.350 --> 19:52.480
But the next stage excites me!

19:52.950 --> 19:55.690
Let's meet again, Kaitō Kid!!

19:59.360 --> 20:02.780
Inside your nightmares…

20:04.740 --> 20:07.120
W-Wait! Spider!!

20:07.120 --> 20:09.950
Stage? The world's greatest...?

20:11.200 --> 20:12.910
Hey, could that guy be?!

20:13.290 --> 20:15.330
Arrest Kid!!

20:15.730 --> 20:17.460
This is bad!! We're going to have to continue this later!

20:19.220 --> 20:21.050
Damn it, Kid!

20:21.460 --> 20:23.920
Spider's after Kaitō Kid…

20:24.430 --> 20:28.720
In that case, being in Japan with Kid is… good…

20:34.000 --> 20:35.290
Hakuba-<i>kun</i>…?

20:40.820 --> 20:43.690
Kid failed at his crime and escaped.

20:43.690 --> 20:47.490
Inspector Nakamori is keeping the Purple-eyed Bronze Statue safe.

20:47.490 --> 20:51.910
But that didn't have the Pandora, so I was the one to leave it there.

20:52.450 --> 20:53.690
Say, Kaito…

20:53.690 --> 20:56.080
Quit reading out loud. You look like an old man.

20:56.080 --> 20:58.660
Excuse me. I'm probably an old man anyway.

20:58.660 --> 21:01.500
Okay, everyone, you have a new friend.

21:02.100 --> 21:06.410
September 4, 9:01:32.41 AM.

21:07.090 --> 21:10.010
I've exchanged schools from London Bridge High School…

21:11.350 --> 21:12.520
This phrase is…

21:13.270 --> 21:15.600
I'm Saguru Hakuba. Nice to meet you.

21:16.650 --> 21:17.810
S-Seriously?

21:19.560 --> 21:21.170
Cool!

21:21.170 --> 21:22.480
He's so hot!

21:22.480 --> 21:24.990
Too bad! You have yet another enemy.

21:24.990 --> 21:27.910
But don't forget that I'll be the one to defeat you, okay?

21:27.910 --> 21:29.990
Say, what do you mean by ‘enemy?’

21:30.860 --> 21:32.300
I-I-It's nothing.

21:32.290 --> 21:32.950
Huh?

21:40.170 --> 21:44.760
What? That Kaitō Kid isn't the Kid from 8 years ago?!

21:46.170 --> 21:49.590
Of course he would look different. He escaped that explosion.

21:49.590 --> 21:53.060
He must've improved his skills to adapt to his enemies.

21:49.590 --> 21:53.060
‘Tōichi Kuroba's Great Escape from the Flames’

21:54.700 --> 21:56.660
If you want to think so, then go ahead and think that.

21:57.090 --> 22:01.070
I'll take care of Kid. I'm just doing my job.

22:01.790 --> 22:03.230
Hey, wait!

22:19.570 --> 22:21.920
Ladies and gentlemen.

22:22.420 --> 22:25.420
Welcome to my great illusion.

22:47.420 --> 22:50.930
Koi ni Koishite
(Falling in love)

22:47.420 --> 22:50.930
(Mai Kuraki)

22:51.630 --> 22:56.300
I’m not interested in you at all — I’m lying, you are my perfect guy

22:56.800 --> 23:01.310
I can’t hide my beating heart, I’m really into you, I can’t help it

23:01.850 --> 23:06.310
I’m no good at love, with a bad style, I become someone else when facing you

23:06.890 --> 23:10.770
I don’t tell anyone about it

23:11.900 --> 23:15.860
Still, I’m alright, love just isn’t for me

23:16.200 --> 23:20.160
and it still isn’t the last chance for me

23:20.780 --> 23:25.790
I have many love stories carved into my heart

23:25.960 --> 23:31.040
but they’re far from my ideals

23:31.540 --> 23:36.470
I know I’m selfish but...

23:36.630 --> 23:42.640
...is there anything wrong with that?

23:43.310 --> 23:52.980
Just being in love with you is enough, I couldn’t confess even if I wanted to...

23:53.270 --> 24:05.750
I’m happier with it being a secret, so for now, it’ll be my secret love

24:00.370 --> 24:06.420
To Conan
Edogawa-<i>kun</i>

24:08.020 --> 24:12.190
The world's biggest ruby, the Red Tear, is in the hands of the group ‘Hopper's Magic.’

24:12.190 --> 24:16.830
